OL,3,AMan arrested after Swiss rave shooting
OL,4,Athat killed woman
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The investigation into the exact
OL,7,Fsequence of events, the background, and
OL,8,Fthe possible motive is currently
OL,9,Funderway. At this time, it is assumed
OL,10,Fthat the perpetrator acted alone,"
OL,11,Fpolice said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
